  "scope": "For arbitrary unital rings in one Lean universe: tensoring by a bimodule is additive and preserves finite colimits and all coproducts of that universe; conversely each additive finite-colimit and coproduct-preserving functor is naturally isomorphic to the concrete tensor functor attached to its value on the lifted regular module. Both directions use Mathlib preservation typeclasses.",
